# Janitor — adopted / custom hogs
# Lives at: ~/.config/janitor/hogs
# Created by: janitor adopt <id>  or  janitor hog add <path>
#
# Catalog adopt (one id per line):
# shipit
#
# Custom path hog:
# custom:<id>|<path>|<mode>|<label>
# custom:my_tool|~/Library/Caches/my-tool|contents|My tool cache
#
# Paths must be under an allowlisted cache root (see janitor hog add).
# Never Documents, Downloads, media, or personal files.
